<footer class="site-footer"><div class="container"><div class="footer-top"><a class="footer-brand" href="/" aria-label="ESCS — inicio">ESCS<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p>Aprender para hacer.<br/>Tecnología para avanzar.</p><a href="#main-content" class="back-top" aria-label="Volver al inicio">VOLVER ARRIBA <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} ESCS. Todos los derechos reservados.</span><div><a href="/privacidad/">Privacidad</a><button type="button" data-consent-settings>Preferencias de cookies</button><span class="footer-location">HECHO PARA EL MUNDO REAL ↗</span></div></div></div></footer>
<style>
  .site-footer { padding-block:3rem 1.3rem; }.footer-top { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto; gap:2rem; align-items:center; padding-bottom:2.4rem; }.footer-brand { font-size:52px; font-weight:800; line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.07em; }.footer-brand>span { font-size:12px; font-weight:400; vertical-align:top; margin-left:.4rem; line-height:2; letter-spacing:0; }.footer-top>p { font-size:11px; line-height:1.9; color:var(--color-muted); }.back-top { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1.5rem; min-height:44px; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:.05em; }.back-top>span { font-size:18px; color:var(--color-accent); }.footer-bottom { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:1.5rem; align-items:center; border-top:1px solid var(--color-line); padding-top:1rem; color:var(--color-muted); font-size:8px; }.footer-bottom>div { display:flex; gap:1.7rem; align-items:center; }.footer-bottom a,.footer-bottom button { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; min-height:44px; }.footer-bottom button { background:none; border:0; padding:0; font-size:8px; }.footer-bottom a:hover,.footer-bottom button:hover { color:var(--color-accent); }.footer-location { font-size:7px; letter-spacing:.07em; }
  @media(max-width:699px) { .site-footer { padding-top:2.3rem; }.footer-top { grid-template-columns:1fr auto; gap:1.5rem; padding-bottom:1.6rem; }.footer-brand { font-size:40px; }.footer-top>p { font-size:10px; }.back-top { grid-column:1/-1; justify-content:space-between; border-top:1px solid var(--color-line); padding-top:.6rem; }.footer-bottom { flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:.2rem; }.footer-bottom>div { width:100%; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.3rem 1.5rem; }.footer-location { width:100%; margin-block:.5rem; } }
</style>

